# THIS IS THE DEVELOPMENT UNIT (aetherseed, 192.168.1.51), not a shipped
# build. It is committed as the reference point the device is currently
# known-good against. Recapture on a real build and commit that instead;
# git history then records exactly what each cartridge contained.
#
#   tools/cartridge.sh capture tools/cartridge.manifest
#   tools/cartridge.sh verify  tools/cartridge.manifest    -> 0 match, 1 drift
